  "title": {
   "en": "Uragirareta no de, Ouhitsuki Jijo ni Job Change!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "裏切られたので、王妃付き侍女にジョブチェンジ！"
   },
   {
    "ja": "婚約者に裏切られたので、子爵令嬢から王妃付き侍女にジョブチェンジしてみた"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Uragirareta node, Ouhitsuki Jijo ni Job Change!"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Keiyakusha ni Uragirareta no de, Shishaku Reijou kara Ouhitsukijijo ni Jobu Chenji shite mita"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Was Betrayed, so I Changed My Job to the Queen's Maid of Honor!"
   },
   {
    "en": "From Ordinary Maid to Chief Lady-in-Waiting to the Queen"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Used to Be a Viscount's Daughter. Betrayed by My Fiancé, I Job-Changed to a Queen's Handmaid"
   },
   {
    "ko": "배신당해서 왕비님의 전속 시녀로 직업 체인지!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Marsha, the daughter of a nobleman, gave up on love after discovering her fiancé’s betrayal—determined to show him what true feminine pride looks like. Years later, Marsha has become the queen’s chief lady-in-waiting at the royal court, excelling at her duties amid mysterious events, conspiracies, and sometimes even unexpected love stories.\n\nDespite her success, her confidence in matters of love is nearly nonexistent. Will she be able to find her path to happiness in a palace world full of surprises?\n\n---\nOn the day of her debutante at the age of fifteen, Marsha, a viscount's daughter, witnesses a meeting between her fiancé, Raul, and princess Priscilla. However, Marsha decides to \"continue her engagement\" with Raul who does not wish to break off their engagement! Ten years later, in the royal palace, Masha has become the Queen's handmaid and spends her days wielding her skills?!\n\nAn exhilarating royal romance story from \"Let's become a novelist\"!"
  },
